  "247": {
    "caption": "Chart-topping country anthems + timeless holiday classics = the ultimate November night out! \n\nTwo Canadian country icons, one stage, and a whole lot of holiday cheer. George Canyon and Aaron Pritchett are hitting our mainstage with Cowboy Christmas 2\u2014bringing together the big hits you love to sing along to and the festive classics that make the season bright.\n\nGEORGE CANYON & AARON PRITCHETT\nA Cowboy Christmas 2\nThursday, November 12, 2026 at 7:30 PM\n\nWhy not make a full night of it? Grab your boots and your favourite show buddy, and start the evening with a great local bite right down the road.\n\nSummerside is packed with fantastic spots to grab dinner or a drink before the lights go down\u2014or a sweet treat to finish off the night:\n\n@brothers2restaurant \n@summersideshipyard\n@evermoorebrewing \n@pepperscrafterssummerside \nFiveelevenwest \n@holmansicecream \n\nSupport local, treat yourself to a wonderful meal, and then stroll on over to join us for an incredible night of music!\n\nTickets: On sale now at harbourfronttheatre.com or call our box office at 902-888-2500!\n\n#HarbourfrontTheatre #GeorgeCanyon #AaronPritchett #CowboyChristmas #SummersidePEI #PEIMusic #LiveMusicPEI #PEIEvents #IslandTheatre #EatLocalPEI",
